{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default","page":"\tᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰀᰦ ᰋᰫᰯ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫᰲ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰓᰩᰵ ᰃᰪᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [1] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰜ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰩ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰕᰪᰳ ᰉᰦᰮ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ [2] ᰣᰨ ᰍᰩᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰡᰩᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰓᰩᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰨᰵ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ [3] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰣᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰎᰴ ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰚ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰣᰶ ᰚᰨ [4] ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰕ ᰃᰦᰳ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ [5] ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰙᰩᰮ ᰣᰦ ᰊᰤᰬᰰ ᰙᰨ ᰡᰩᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨ [6] ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰚ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰝᰥᰤᰩᰱ ᰣᰦ ᰅᰪᰭᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰃᰨ [7] ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰃᰨ ᰚ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰊᰤᰬᰰ ᰣᰦ ᰉᰧᰳᰶ [8] ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰃᰨ ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰃᰨ ᰚ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ [9] ᰕᰦᰳ ᰊ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰃᰨ ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰃᰨ ᰚ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [10] ᰠᰦᰭ ᰌᰩᰭ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰜᰤᰦᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰃᰨ ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰃᰨ ᰚ ᰎᰦ [11] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰌᰧᰭᰶ ᰎᰫ ᰜ ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰚ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ [12] ᰚᰨ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰃᰨ ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰠ [13] ᰃᰨ ᰡᰫ ᰜ ᰕ ᰚᰪᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ ᰕ ᰚᰪᰰ [14] ᰍᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰫᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰣᰦ ᰞᰤᰩᰳ ᰞᰦᰱ [15] ᰃᰨᰵ ᰜ ᰕ ᰚᰪᰰ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰠᰪᰵ ᰕᰪᰳ ᰀᰦ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰎᰨ ᰊᰤᰬᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰞᰦᰱ [16] ᰃᰨᰵ ᰜ ᰕ ᰚᰰᰶ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰃᰤᰩ ᰠ ᰇᰨ [17] ᰞᰦᰱ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰕ ᰚᰰᰶ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰡᰫ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ [18] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰛᰨ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰕ ᰛᰩ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ [19] ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ ᰛᰨ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ [20] ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰫ ᰑᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰠ ᰍᰦᰱ ᰀᰦ ᰛᰨ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [21] ᰣᰫ ᰡᰩᰱ ᰛᰬ ᰠ ᰉᰧ ᰀᰦ ᰛᰫ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ [22] ᰛᰬ ᰡᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰛᰫ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰨᰵ ᰡᰪ [23] ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰠ ᰃᰨ ᰕ ᰊᰪᰰ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰀᰦᰳ [24] ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ [25] ᰕ ᰊᰪᰰ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [26] ᰠ ᰊᰫᰮ ᰠ ᰠ ᰣᰦᰲ ᰕ ᰊᰪᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰩᰭ ᰑᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰫ ᰡᰩᰱ [27] ᰕ ᰊᰪᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰼ ᰀ ᰈᰫ ᰠ ᰕᰰᰶ ᰕ ᰊᰪᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰇᰨ ᰕ ᰊᰪᰰ [28] ᰍᰪᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎᰦ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ [29] ᰠᰦ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰤᰬᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ [30] ᰜ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰀᰤᰬᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [31] ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰛᰦᰮ ᰠᰦᰮ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰋᰦᰮ ᰆᰪᰵᰶ ᰋᰦᰮ ᰓᰪ ᰓᰦᰮ ᰉᰧ [32] ᰅᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰀᰤᰬᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰛᰦᰮ ᰣᰫᰵ ᰛᰦᰮ ᰠᰦᰮ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰅᰦᰰ [33] ᰍᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰇᰨ ᰓᰫ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰀᰤᰬᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰓᰨ ᰕᰫ [34] ᰉᰬᰳ ᰜ ᰐᰤᰪᰭ ᰀᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰀᰪᰱ ᰛᰬ ᰀᰤᰬᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰡᰨ [35] ᰠ ᰌᰫᰭ ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰀᰤᰬᰳ ᰕ ᰚᰩᰵ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ [36] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰡᰫ ᰜ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰩ ᰛᰩ [37] ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰫ ᰓᰦ ᰉᰧ ᰅᰪᰵ [38] ᰀᰦ ᰜ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰅᰫ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰪᰳ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰦ [39] ᰋᰤᰦᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰉᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰪᰳ ᰛᰬ ᰊ ᰁᰫᰵ ᰀᰦ [40] ᰉᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰇᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰊᰤᰦᰱ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰀᰦ ᰉᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [41] ᰎᰪᰰ ᰌᰧ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ [42] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰜᰦ ᰕᰦ ᰕᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ [43] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰀ ᰠᰪ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰌᰧ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰣᰦ [44] ᰠᰩᰮ ᰡᰫᰭ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰊ ᰣ ᰚᰴ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ [45] ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰠᰩᰮ ᰡᰫᰭ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰤᰦᰱ [46] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰇᰨ ᰠ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰜᰩᰮ ᰛᰬ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰜ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜᰤᰬᰯ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ [47] ᰌᰤᰬᰭ ᰡᰫᰭ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰡᰧᰮᰶ ᰉᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰜᰩᰮ ᰛᰬ ᰛᰤᰫ [48] ᰜ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰌᰤᰬᰭ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰫᰭ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ ᰇᰨ [49] ᰠ ᰌᰫᰭ ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰌᰤᰬᰭ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰫᰭ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ [50] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ ᰠ ᰊᰩᰮ ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰎᰴ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ [51] ᰡᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰵ ᰃᰴ ᰃᰨ ᰠᰦᰭ [52] ᰣᰦ ᰈᰬᰮ ᰜ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦᰵ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ [53] ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰣᰦ [54] ᰊᰧᰮᰶ ᰣᰦ ᰝᰥᰤᰬᰰ ᰓᰫ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰪᰳ ᰀᰦ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰙᰨᰵ ᰠ ᰌᰧᰭᰶ [55] ᰎᰫ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰜ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰙᰩᰵ ᰓᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰡᰫ ᰕᰦᰳ [56] ","annotations":[{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"1","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r1","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"\tᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰀᰦ ᰋᰫᰯ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫᰲ ᰛᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰓᰩᰵ ᰃᰪᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default#xywh=340,351,2333,99"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"2","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r2","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰜ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰩ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰕᰪᰳ ᰉᰦᰮ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default#xywh=346,477,2333,93"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"3","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r3","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰣᰨ ᰍᰩᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰡᰩᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰓᰩᰵ ᰣᰤᰪᰮ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰨᰵ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default#xywh=334,600,2375,90"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"4","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r4","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰝᰩ ᰣᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰎᰴ ᰕ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰍ ᰚ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰣᰶ ᰚᰨ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default#xywh=334,723,2249,105"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"5","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r5","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ ᰓᰦ ᰞᰦᰱ ᰕ ᰃᰦᰳ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default#xywh=316,789,2351,170"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"6","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326390\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r6","type":"Anno